WEBVTT

47:05.557 --> 47:07.226
NED: I'm a Northman.

47:08.936 --> 47:13.440
I belong here with you, not down south
in that rats' nest they call a capital.

47:14.483 --> 47:17.236
I won't let him take you.

47:18.779 --> 47:21.365
The king takes what he wants.

47:21.490 --> 47:23.784
(SNORTS) That's why he's king.

47:24.827 --> 47:28.497
I'll say, "Listen, fat man."

47:28.622 --> 47:29.665
(HE LAUGHS)

47:29.790 --> 47:32.918
"You are not taking
my husband anywhere.
